        "Description": "47 the ICA has an emergency contract. The italian mafia as haunted sapienza for years and now their lider Marco Abiatti is running for office, our client Viktor Novikov is concerned about is brand sanguine staying in his home town,  you have been cleared to engage. Eliminate Marco Abiatti and their parteners as cleanly as possible, avoiding collateral damage as far as possible. I will leave you to prepare.",
